{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:Glossary.GlossaryDescent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"Glossary.GlossaryDescent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DescentData.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DescentData.level","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-descent.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Source brane level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DescentData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DescentData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-descent.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.DescentData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.DescentData","kind":"structure","line":13,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-descent.lean#L13-L27","doc":"Descent data: restriction from brane level n to level n-1.\n\nMaps to Mathlib: analogous to `CategoryTheory.EffectiveEpiFamily`\nor descent data in a fibered category.\n\n**`restriction_exists : Prop` removed 2026-09-07. It promised \"the restriction\nmorphism `r_n : A_n -> A_{n-1}` exists\" and asserted nothing: typed with the\n*universe* `Prop`, so an instance chose the proposition and `True` was legal.\nNothing read it and nothing constructed it. Stating it needs the morphism as\na field, which this glossary wrapper does not carry.** ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:rem:glossary-descent","label":"rem:glossary-descent","md":"quantum-observable-universe/glossary/glossary-descent.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}